<p>We are so grateful that the Lord has made a way for all of us to be in the Pacific Northwest during our pre-field ministry days.</p>
<p>We are praying that the door will be open for us to return to Japan in the spring of 2027. In order to do so, we must first be fully supported financially. Currently, we are at over 80% of reqxuired support!</p>
<p>Please join us in prayer for the brothers and sisters back in Japan and for those who are not yet in God&rsquo;s family, that they would respond to the gospel message with repentance and faith in the Lord Jesus Christ. Pray also that we woudl patiently wait for the Lord's timing on our return to Japan.</p>
